{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it was like to be a sausage? With only a seesaw motion you need to overcome the most difficult and frustrating obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play the story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where sausages are considered expandable. Son sausage has been thrown out like yesterdays trash. Dad sausage needs to leave his comfort zone to rescue his son before he becomes minced meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.poster.avif?t=1761564706\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.webm?t=1761564706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.mp4?t=1761564706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult</strong> casual 3D precision platformer physics game. No enemies are out to get you, but that doesn't mean it's easy. Take your time, you are going to need it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the story, 9 levels on easy or hardcore mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the challenge levels if you like to suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time yourself against friends in the online leaderboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406120?t=1761564706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406120?t=1761564706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/94f6bcdac272cff2439db3255a8a98041f2f4fd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761564706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/94f6bcdac272cff2439db3255a8a98041f2f4fd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761564706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it was like to be a sausage? With only a seesaw motion you need to overcome the most difficult and frustrating obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play the story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where sausages are considered expandable. Son sausage has been thrown out like yesterdays trash. Dad sausage needs to leave his comfort zone to rescue his son before he becomes minced meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.poster.avif?t=1761564706\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.webm?t=1761564706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406120/extras/44fce80760b9913dd66071745773d6f9.mp4?t=1761564706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult</str